<title>USA: Market Facts sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Market Facts sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON HEIGHTS, Ill. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market Facts Inc, a market research company, said on Monday it has declared a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The 100 percent stock dividend will be distributed December 13, 1996 to shareholders of record at the close of business on November 22, 1996, Market Facts said.</p>
<p>Market Facts has approximately two million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
